 she'll put in a good  word for monica and ends up securing a  date with the movie star herself in a  flashback scene to the 1980s from a  later episode rachel kisses chandler  while knowing monica was crushing on him  but the worst was yet to come in the  season 7 episode the one with monica's  thunder rachel starts feeling lonely  because monica has found her person in  chandler and she still hasn't on the  night of a planned outing to celebrate  the newly engaged couple's news rachel  goes to ross and starts kissing him  planning a bonus one night stand night  with him monica opens her apartment door  to see her brother kissing rachel in the  hall she accuses the exes of stealing  all of the attention by reuniting on  what was supposed to be her big night  for monica this was the rachel move that  really went too far while that scene has  gone down in history as one of rachel's  worst moments she later one-ups monica  at her own wedding just before monica  and chandler's wedding phoebe discovers  a discarded positive pregnancy test in  the trashcan of monica and chandler's  bathroom she believes that it's monica's  but when monica clears the air and says  she isn't expecting phoebe makes a snap  decision and pretends she is to cover  for rachel later on rachel takes a  pregnancy test during the wedding  reception when monica is supposed to be  celebrating many friends fans agree that  rachel could have gone about this  differently and not overstepped on  monica and chandler's special day as  this was coming near the end of the  series run for friends it makes sense  sitcoms generally have to keep upping  the ante as they move forward leading to  this major shift for the final few  seasons though monica isn't upset with  rachel about what happens on her wedding  day a detail that baffles fans to this  day the icing on the spotlight stealing  cake is the fact that when rachel gives  birth to her daughter she names her emma  the name monica wanted to name her  daughter one day classic rachel green  move  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite tv series are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

